                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I\u2019ve issued updated guidance for healthcare facilities in Maryland to address immigration enforcement operations. This guidance helps providers comply with federal and state laws while also heeding their obligations to their patients.\u00a0 We want all residents to have access toessential healthcare services without fear.\n\u00a0\nOur goal is to safeguard patient rights and ensure healthcare facilities continue their mission of delivering care to everyone in Maryland.\n\u00a0\nFull Press Release and Guidance Here: https://t.co/5xo5Xr8omv",
