                "text": "Today, I announced the sentencing of a woman who posed as a nurse and defrauded Medicaid. She worked at a Maryland nursing facility without a license, putting patients at risk. My Office will continue to hold fraudsters accountable and protect vulnerable Marylanders.\n\nFull Press Release: https://t.co/gS3pp0Ljbj",
