                "text": "I joined a coalition of 15 attorneys general to reaffirm our commitment to protecting access to gender-affirming care. Healthcare decisions should be made by patients, families, and doctors\u2014not politicians.\u00a0\n\nPlease read our full statement here: https://t.co/qi3d8pB5PP https://t.co/42tTRW8NJc",
