                "text": "National Consumer Protection Week Day 4: Health Insurance & Medical Bills\n\nDenied insurance coverage? Hit with a surprise medical bill? My office can help resolve disputes with insurance companies and hospitals. Get help: https://t.co/g0hUokZ6P3 or call 410-528-1840. https://t.co/drk8kqOqjH",
