                "retweet_count": 14,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I joined 12 attorneys general urging SCOTUS  to uphold Medicaid patients\u2019 right to choose their own qualified healthcare providers, including Planned Parenthood. These decisions should be guided by medical expertise and patients\u2019 own personal\nchoices, not outside influences.\n\nFull press release: https://t.co/ZVX2J7D4Zv",
