                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Celebrating 15 years of the Affordable Care Act! Since 2010, the ACA has expanded access to healthcare, protected those with pre-existing conditions, and ensured vital coverage for millions. Its impact continues to strengthen communities across Maryland and beyond. \n\n#ACAAnniversary",
