                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Everyone deserves access to affordable health care\u2014no matter their immigration status, income, or gender identity.\n\nI joined a coalition of attorneys general opposing dangerous federal proposals that would take coverage away from up to 2 million people, block Dreamers from buying insurance, and raise costs for families across the country. We\u2019re standing up to protect coverage and care for all.\n\nFull press release: https://t.co/uD2sfkb7Zb",
