                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "No one should risk arrest or harm just to qualify to care for patients. \n\nThat\u2019s why I joined 19 other attorneys general today urging the American Medical Association (AMA) to protect abortion and gender-affirming care providers from dangerous board certification rules. Read full release here: https://t.co/c1vuPZAnVN",
