                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "A federal judge has blocked the Trump Administration\u2019s attempt to cut critical NIH research funding\u2014millions that support scientists at Maryland universities and hospitals. The ruling \u2013 which condemned \u201cclear\u201d evidence of discrimination against the LGBTQ community and racial minorities - protects public health research and pushes back against unfair political interference.\n\nFull release: https://t.co/StH6EBj2nk",
