                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Did you know? The Health Education and Advocacy Unit (HEAU) offers free mediation for billing disputes, denied coverage, surprise medical bills, and more.  \n\nVisit our website https://t.co/iXsDmQpuUe\nor call 410-528-1840 to file your complaint or request a form. https://t.co/KFewWaDU7C",
