                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The Trump administration is pushing a new rule that could cause up to 1.8 million people including 34,000 Marylanders\u2014to lose their health insurance. It threatens to raise premiums, increase out-of-pocket costs, and exclude coverage for gender-affirming care.\n\nI joined a multistate lawsuit to stop it. Marylanders shouldn\u2019t have to choose between rent and lifesaving treatment.\n\nFull press release: https://t.co/3TYvbmbRqO",
