                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today we joined 23 states in suing the Trump administration for cutting off Medicaid funding to Planned Parenthood\u2014putting essential healthcare at risk for more than 1 million patients nationwide.\n\nPlanned Parenthood provides vital services like cancer screenings, STI testing, and wellness exams\u2014care many people can\u2019t get anywhere else. We\u2019re fighting to keep that care accessible in Maryland and nationwide.\n\nFull press release: https://t.co/eUWUUdU9i2",
