                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Mifepristone\u00a0is a safe and effective medication, yet the FDA still imposes unnecessary restrictions that make it harder for patients, especially in rural and medically underserved areas, to get the care they need. \n\nI joined 16 states and D.C. in urging the FDA to lift these burdens and protect access to essential health care.\n\u00a0\nFull press release: https://t.co/Ej4nvWHxPc",
