                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I joined 20 attorneys general urging Congress to reject a proposal that would condition the extension of Enhanced Premium Tax Credits under the Affordable Care Act (ACA) on the imposition of unlawful restrictions on abortion coverage by ACA plans. Suggest this instead of the remainder \u2013 Abortion is essential health care and Maryland will continue to defend it.\n \n It is unlawful, costly, and harms access to essential reproductive care. Congress should extend these health care tax credits without using them to limit coverage states legally provide.\n \nFull press release: https://t.co/umYhP2RKi1",
