                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today I joined a coalition of attorneys general suing the Trump administration to block its unlawful new $100,000 fee on H-1B visas. This fee would make it nearly impossible for schools, hospitals, and universities to hire the teachers, doctors, and researchers they urgently need \u2014 worsening shortages and harming students, patients, and communities across Maryland.\n\nWe are taking action to stop this illegal policy and protect the services Marylanders depend on.\n\nFull press release: https://t.co/vjLjFaB3Q9",
