                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "For decades, Charles Robinson's trusted and fair coverage of Maryland politics and minority communities set the standard for accuracy and integrity. I always appreciated the opportunity to be interviewed by Charles\u2014his effervescent smile, thoughtful questions, and genuine commitment to telling the full story made every conversation meaningful. \n\nHis passing is a loss not just to the journalism community but to all of Maryland. His commitment to mentoring the next generation of journalists ensures his legacy will continue in the countless students and colleagues he inspired throughout his storied career.",
