                "text": "Today, I joined a multistate lawsuit to stop the U.S. Department of Health and Human Services from using an unlawful \u201cdeclaration\u201d to pressure doctors and hospitals and limit access to care for young people.\n\nThis move ignores the normal rule-making process and takes decision-making away from states, doctors, and families. My Office is going to court to protect families, providers, and the rule of law.\n\nFull press release: https://t.co/jl7mV2YP7y",
